  "content": "<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://zap-hosting.com/reggarf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1148167/description_d4f4cb4f-4ed1-41d6-979c-4f4ed15ccaf8.png\" alt=\"\"></strong></a></p>\n<h1 style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong>感謝我們的贊助商</strong></h1>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">感謝 ZAP-HOSTING！使用優惠碼 Reggarf-1047 可享受訂單全額 20% 折扣！</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">https://zap-hosting.com/reggarf</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong><a href=\"https://zap-hosting.com/reggarf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1148167/description_8553830f-f787-4670-8839-419f79e3ee6b.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"400\" height=\"400\"></a><br></strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong><span style=\"color: #3598db;\">AE2: 更好的村民 (AE2: Better Villagers) </span>添加了大量基於 AE2 模組的村莊<span style=\"color: #2dc26b;\">職業</span></strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong><span style=\"color: #2dc26b;\"><br></span></strong><span style=\"color: #3598db;\"><strong>AE2: 更好的村民</strong></span> 是一個以 Applied Energistics 2 (AE2) 機制為核心的新村莊職業模組。該模組通過添加專門化的村民（如<strong><span style=\"color: #ecf0f1;\"><span style=\"color: #f1c40f;\">AE2 工程師</span></span></strong>、<span style=\"color: #2dc26b;\"><strong>AE2 工具匠</strong></span>和 <span style=\"color: #ba372a;\"><strong>AE2 專家</strong></span>）來增強村民互動，他們交易處理器、石英和存儲組件等必需品。它提供了一種沉浸式的體驗，將 AE2 複雜的系統融入遊戲的自然進程中，使資源收集和製作對玩家來說更加引人入勝。</p>\n<hr>\n<h3><span style=\"color: #e03e2d;\">我們類似的項目<br><br><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1148167/description_0861ee51-0976-4c91-9d17-97dbc4973b0f.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\"> <strong><span style=\"color: #2dc26b;\">CREATE: 更好的村民</span> <span style=\"color: #fff;\">: <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/create-better-villager\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\">https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/create-better-villager</a></span></strong></span></h3>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<hr>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<blockquote>\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #f1c40f;\"><strong>MODPACK 開發者必讀</strong></span><br><br></h3>\n</blockquote>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<p>[文件路徑] - config/ae_better_villagers-common.toml</p>\n<p>#注意：您可以根據需要更改文本和 URL。</p>\n<p>[welcome_message]<br>&nbsp; &nbsp; # 啟用或禁用歡迎消息<br>&nbsp; &nbsp; enabled = true<br>&nbsp; &nbsp; # 玩家首次加入遊戲時顯示的消息<br>&nbsp; &nbsp; text = \"感謝我們的贊助商！特別感謝 ZAP-Hosting！使用優惠碼 'Reggarf-1047' 可享受訂單 20% 折扣！\"<br>&nbsp; &nbsp; # 玩家點擊鏈接時打開的 URL<br>&nbsp; &nbsp; url = \"https://zap-hosting.com/reggarf\"</p>\n<p># 額外說明：請保持此配置完整以支持我。謝謝！。</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<h1 style=\"text-align: center;\">&nbsp;</h1>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n</div>\n<hr>\n<h1 style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong><br>功能列表</strong></h1>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong><span style=\"color: #f1c40f;\">AE2 工具匠</span><br></strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"text-align: center; color: #ecf0f1;\"><span style=\"color: #ecf0f1;\">出售工具</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong><span style=\"color: #ecf0f1;\">工作台 - <span style=\"color: #e67e23;\">細胞工作台</span></span></strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #ecf0f1;\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1148167/description_f28d1ad1-3931-4bf1-9d1a-6947daca656d.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"400\" height=\"400\"></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong><span style=\"color: #ecf0f1;\"><span style=\"color: #f1c40f;\">AE2 工程師</span></span></strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"text-align: center; color: #ecf0f1;\"><span style=\"color: #ecf0f1;\">出售機器零件</span><strong><span style=\"color: #ecf0f1;\"><span style=\"color: #f1c40f;\"><br></span></span></strong></li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong><span style=\"color: #ecf0f1;\"><span style=\"color: #f1c40f;\"><span style=\"color: #ecf0f1;\">工作台 - <span style=\"color: #e67e23;\">控制器</span></span><br></span></span></strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong><span style=\"color: #ecf0f1;\"><span style=\"color: #f1c40f;\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1148167/description_72f667d8-5a59-4063-822d-754f38e575e5.png\" alt=\"\"></span></span></strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong><span style=\"color: #ecf0f1;\"><span style=\"color: #f1c40f;\">AE2 專家</span></span></strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"text-align: center; color: #ecf0f1;\"><span style=\"color: #ecf0f1;\">出售磁盤零件</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #ecf0f1;\"><strong><span style=\"color: #f1c40f;\"><span style=\"color: #ecf0f1;\">工作台 - <span style=\"color: #e67e23;\">16K 存儲倉</span></span></span></strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1148167/description_d1753ac2-afec-4f7e-95d9-3d6695f3ee86.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong>在 GitHub 或 Modrinth 上查找 AE2: 更好的村民</strong></h3>\n<h1 style=\"text-align: center;\">&nbsp;</h1>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://zap-hosting.com/reggarf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1148167/description_6835931a-2db5-42a1-8ebe-e7ee30bb025d.gif\" alt=\"\"></strong></a></p>",
